msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: ../../source/index.rst:109 7d22c9dbb773491b9908aad7446afa02
msgid "Select your vehicle type to the left"
msgstr "在左侧选择你的载具类型"

#: ../../source/index.rst:110 1970b30c611f4cd399bb4908ae47c21e
msgid ""
"Select your \"AutoPilot Hardware\" and \"Peripheral Hardware\" for your "
"application"
msgstr "为你的应用选择「飞控硬件」与「外设硬件」"

#: ../../source/index.rst:111 9fbe874372444f80800d82df139ca950
msgid ""
"Follow vehicle's \"First Time Setup\"  for installing the firmware and "
"Ground Station software, connecting the components, and calibration steps"
msgstr "按照载具对应的「首次配置」安装固件与地面站软件、连接组件并完成校准"

#: ../../source/index.rst:112 b7064392b48a4f28978736ac16687aef
msgid ""
"Prepare for \"First Flight(/Drive)\" completing setup prior to first "
"flight/drive"
msgstr "按照「首飞 / 首次试驶」准备并在首飞 / 首次试驶前完成余下配置"

#: ../../source/index.rst:113 ed436648bec94f259eb1231f4fd171eb
msgid ""
"Advanced Configuration offers setup of more advanced features of the "
"firmware and hardware peripherals"
msgstr "「高级配置」提供固件与硬件外设更深入功能的设置"

#: ../../source/index.rst:115 06463f9a76e048ea92d459bb989e5cc4
msgid ""
"If you can't readily find an answer to an ArduPilot setup question, you can "
"try `AI! <https://gurubase.io/g/ardupilot>`__. Bear in mind its "
"experimental!"
msgstr ""
"如果一时找不到 ArduPilot 配置问题的答案，可以尝试 `AI! "
"<https://gurubase.io/g/ardupilot>`__。请注意它仍是实验性的！"

#: ../../source/index.rst:118 9f165099a9d04c598f64a4376dd62704
msgid "Regulations"
msgstr "法规"

#: ../../source/index.rst:120 ed807c24d54643549f6f81966b67682e
msgid ""
"Every country has different regulations governing the operation of remote "
"controlled and/or autonomous vehicles. `This database "
"<https://droneregulations.info>`__  has country specific information, but it"
" is every operator's responsibility to be seek out and be aware of local, "
"regional, and federal regulations."
msgstr ""
"各国对遥控载具与自主载具的运行均有不同法规要求。`此数据库 <https://droneregulations.info>`__ "
"提供按国家/地区组织的相关信息，但每位操作者仍有责任主动了解并遵守当地、地区与国家层面的相关法规。"

